        2,
        3
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Enforce has preconditions",
      "what": "Enforce mode terminates and counts as killed, but a sensor refuses to start in enforce mode without a scope (namespace or all namespaces).",
      "why": "Identity: the Docker guide has the sensor hold its own signing key; the Kubernetes guide uses a cluster-signed service account token. Neither was tested.",
